# opencode runtime state. It only lands here on a host whose ~/.config/opencode
# is still a stale whole-directory symlink into dotfiles — see
# nix/docs/stale-home-manager-links.md. Tracked so the protection reaches every
# host, unlike the per-directory .gitignore this replaces.
